page InitPage
  Section id:"init-introduction" py:{ xs:6 md:10 }
    Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:"1fr auto" } gap:5 align:"end"
      Grid columns:1 gap:3
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "START HERE / PROJECT SETUP"
        Title size:{ xs:"3xl" md:"6xl" } weight:"black"
          "Dowe Init"
        Text size:"lg" color:"muted"
          "Create a complete Dowe project in the current directory, with source, editor settings, local environment files, and agent-ready guidance."
      Button:
        href:"/docs/dev/install"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"primary"
        size:"sm"
        rounded:"full"
        iconStart:"document-text"
        "Install Dowe first"
  Section id:"init-command" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "YOUR FIRST PROJECT"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Initialize the directory you want to own"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Create or enter an empty directory, then run the interactive command. Dowe asks which starter to use and whether to add English and Spanish localization catalogs."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy first project commands"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          mkdir my-dowe-app
          cd my-dowe-app
          dowe init
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "INTERACTIVE"
            Title size:"xl" weight:"black"
              "Choose the right starting point"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Select CRUD for a complete fullstack example or blank for the smallest Hello Dowe application, then decide whether the project needs i18n."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "AUTOMATION"
            Title size:"xl" weight:"black"
              "Skip the menus"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Use an explicit template in scripts, CI preparation, or any workflow where the same project shape must be created deterministically."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy template commands"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          dowe init --template crud
          dowe init --template crud --i18n
          dowe init --template blank
          dowe init --template blank --i18n
        """
  Section id:"init-templates" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "TWO CANONICAL STARTERS"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Start small or study the full system"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Both templates use the same Dowe Source Format and the same Rust-owned compiler. The difference is how much application structure they create for you."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:2 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:3
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "CRUD"
            Title size:"xl" weight:"black"
              "A production-shaped fullstack example"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Creates an editorial blogs application with users, sessions, authentication, public listing, owner-scoped writes, a persistent View Store, and focused modal workflows."
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Its Database declaration defaults to the local Dowe provider. Provider selection remains server configuration, so init never asks you to choose a database."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:3
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "BLANK"
            Title size:"xl" weight:"black"
              "The shortest path to Hello Dowe"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Creates one visible page and one GET /api/hello endpoint. Use it when you want to learn the project boundary before adding your own routes, views, and server modules."
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Add --i18n to either template when the first version should include English and Spanish catalogs."
  Section id:"init-project" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "PROJECT BOUNDARY"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Know what Dowe creates"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "The root files connect the application. Frontend modules stay under views, backend modules stay under server, and generated development output does not exist until a later command compiles the project."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy project structure"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          main.dowe
          theme.dowe
          .env.example
          .env
          .gitignore
          .zed/settings.json
          views/
            routes/
            layouts/
            pages/
          server/
            endpoints.dowe
            handlers/
          .agents/
          AGENTS.md
          CLAUDE.md
        """
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Source at the root"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "main.dowe owns application wiring, theme.dowe owns the design system, and imports use the project-root @/ alias."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Local values stay local"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              ".env.example declares shareable names. The generated .env contains local development values and is excluded from Git."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Agents start with context"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Init installs the project Agent Harness and four focused public authoring skills so coding agents can inspect the same Dowe contracts."
  Section id:"init-safety" py:{ xs:7 md:10 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "SAFE INITIALIZATION"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "No partial project and no silent overwrite"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Dowe validates every destination before it writes. A conflict stops new-project initialization without leaving a partially copied template."
      Grid columns:{ xs:1 md:3 } gap:4
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"primary" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"primary"
              "EXISTING PROJECT"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "main.dowe is the marker"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "Interactive init asks before reinstalling managed files and defaults to keeping the existing project unchanged."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "NON-INTERACTIVE"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Never overwrite"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "An explicit --template run against an existing project fails before writing and asks you to use an interactive terminal."
        Card variant:"soft" scheme:"surface" p:5 rounded:"md"
          Grid columns:1 gap:2
            Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" color:"muted"
              "GENERATED OUTPUT"
            Title size:"lg" weight:"bold"
              "Init leaves .dowe absent"
            Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
              "The .dowe directory is ignored and created only by later development, validation, build, or deploy commands."
      Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
        "Initialization does not run development automatically, initialize Git, install node_modules, add Tailwind, or execute authored source through Node.js."
  Section id:"init-next" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:6
      Grid columns:1 gap:2
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "NEXT STEP"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Start the generated project"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Run the fullstack development targets from the same directory. Dowe compiles main.dowe and its imports, starts the server and web views, and writes disposable artifacts below .dowe."
      Code:
        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy development command"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"dowe dev --target server --target web"
      Button:
        href:"/docs/dev/dev"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"primary"
        size:"sm"
        rounded:"full"
        iconStart:"code"
        "Continue to Dowe Dev"
